{"ticker":"BE","updated":"2026-11-13T22:41:27Z","profile":{"longName":"Bloom Energy Corporation","shortName":"Bloom Energy Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bloomenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":2214,"marketCap":56763133952,"trailingPE":116.35758,"forwardPE":36.06184,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":14.820898,"pegRatio":0.35,"targetMeanPrice":283.84616,"targetHighPrice":380.0,"targetLowPrice":102.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":1.381,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.31768,"operatingMargins":0.14333999,"profitMargins":0.13533,"totalRevenue":3829938944,"beta":3.618,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":351.28,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":75.7,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Bloom Energy Corporation designs, manufactures, sells, and installs solid oxide fuel cell systems for on-site power generation in the United States and internationally. It offers Bloom Energy Server, an energy server platform to convert fuel, such as natural gas, biogas, hydrogen, or a blend of these fuels, into electricity through a non-combustion electrochemical process. The company also provides Bloom Electrolyzer for producing hydrogen. It sells its products through direct and indirect sales channels to utilities, data centers, retail, healthcare, education, telecom, manufacturing, and other industries. The company was formerly known as Ion America Corp. and changed its name to Bloom Energy Corporation in 2006. Bloom Energy Corporation was incorporated in 2001 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","summary_zh":"Bloom Energy Corporation 設計、製造、銷售和安裝用於美國和國際現場發電的固體氧化物燃料電池系統。它提供 Bloom Energy Server，這是一個能源伺服器平台，可透過非燃燒電化學過程將天然氣、沼氣、氫氣或這些燃料的混合物等燃料轉換為電力。該公司還提供用於生產氫氣的布魯姆電解器。它透過直接和間接銷售管道向公用事業、資料中心、零售、醫療保健、教育、電信、製造和其他行業銷售其產品。該公司前身為 Ion America Corp.，於 2006 年更名為 Bloom Energy Corporation。 Bloom Energy Corporation 成立於 2001 年，總部位於加州聖荷西。","sect